  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 711.06 Sampling Protocol for Regulated Inorganics",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 711.06 Sampling Protocol for Regulated Inorganics. An O/O shall conduct sample collection for the regulated inorganics listed in Env-Dw 704 using the sample preservation, container, and maximum holding time procedures specified in 40 CFR 141, 142, or 143, as applicable.\n\nSource. #9700, eff 5-1-10; ss by #10771, eff 2-1-15; ss by #12668, eff 1-1-19",
